198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Building your own EV charging management solution also allows you to define proprietary software functionality, prioritize the timelines, and build a comprehensive implementation schedule. For example, a utility spinning off an EVSP has very specific insights about private and business behavior patterns, what changes are needed to electrical infrastructure, the best resource prioritization, and assigning the right personnel to accelerate the process.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [19]
>>
